WEBVTT

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.559
It was clear that her work on the couch
reached far beyond what happens at home.

00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:04.726
So I was excited to learn
that she has a new podcast, "How's Work?"

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.601
It turns out personal
and professional relationships

00:01:07.625 --> 00:01:09.309
have a lot in common.

00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:12.000
(Upbeat music)

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:16.643
I'm Adam Grant.

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:18.768
And this is WorkLife, my podcast with TED,

00:01:18.792 --> 00:01:23.000
sponsored by Accenture,
BetterUp, Hilton and SAP.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.893
I'm an organizational psychologist.

00:01:25.917 --> 00:01:28.601
I study how to make work not suck.

00:01:28.625 --> 00:01:32.625
And one of the reasons work sucks
for so many people is other people.